{"page":270,"verses":[{"verse_key":"16:27","surah":16,"ayah":27,"ar_uthmani":"ثُمَّ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ يُخْزِيهِمْ وَيَقُولُ أَيْنَ شُرَكَآءِىَ ٱلَّذِينَ كُنتُمْ تُشَـٰٓقُّونَ فِيهِمْ ۚ قَالَ ٱلَّذِينَ أُوتُوا۟ ٱلْعِلْمَ إِنَّ ٱلْخِزْىَ ٱلْيَوْمَ وَٱلسُّوٓءَ عَلَى ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"In the end, on the Day of Resurrection, He will shame them, saying, ‘Where are these “partners” of Mine on whose account you opposed [Me]?’ Those given knowledge will say, ‘Shame and misery on the disbelievers today!’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"16:27"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(on) the Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"16:27"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Resurrection","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","verse_key":"16:27"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُخْزِيهِمْ","en_gloss":"He will disgrace them","transliteration":"yukh'zīhim","verse_key":"16:27"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَيَقُولُ","en_gloss":"and say","transliteration":"wayaqūlu","verse_key":"16:27"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَيْنَ","en_gloss":"Where","transliteration":"ayna","verse_key":"16:27"},{"pos":7,"ar":"شُرَكَآءِىَ","en_gloss":"(are) My partners","transliteration":"shurakāiya","verse_key":"16:27"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those (for) whom","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"16:27"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you used (to)","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"16:27"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تُشَـٰٓقُّونَ","en_gloss":"oppose","transliteration":"tushāqqūna","verse_key":"16:27"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِيهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"[in them]","transliteration":"fīhim","verse_key":"16:27"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"Will say","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"16:27"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"16:27"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أُوتُوا۟","en_gloss":"were given","transliteration":"ūtū","verse_key":"16:27"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْعِلْمَ","en_gloss":"the knowledge"